iminating the others.<br><br><strong>Weapon Customization:</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217860/extras/15ac91304c53a1deedbac235ec5349a7.poster.avif?t=1728664346\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217860/extras/15ac91304c53a1deedbac235ec5349a7.webm?t=1728664346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217860/extras/15ac91304c53a1deedbac235ec5349a7.mp4?t=1728664346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Mastering your play style will reward you with an array of weapon attachments. <br>Completely overhaul your favorite weapons with barrels, stocks, suppressors, lasers, and ammo.<br><br>Master each level and become the ultimate assassin.",
